Eduka-MultiColor uses the Graphite GTK theme
(https://github.com/vinceliuice/Graphite-gtk-theme, light, standard size) by
vinceliuice, built with its install.sh (sassc) and renamed for Edukasaun OS.
Licensed under the GNU GPL version 3 (see COPYING).

Graphite gives GTK applications a calm light grey base; Eduka-Desktop,
Eduka-Panel and the Action Center add the colors: every category, tile and
button group gets its own color from the Eduka-MultiColor palette.
The xfwm4 and openbox-3 window borders are generated by
tools/gen-wm-themes.py with Graphite light colors.
